"| Uhrzeit (nur bei hinterlegten Einstellungen)\n"
"| Systemupdate der Anlage\n"
"| Update-Entität\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/third-party/home-assistant.adoc
msgid ""
"**Default:** After setup, only some components and only a few channels "
"within them are active, including the total values (`+_sum+`: consumption, "
"production, grid, storage), state of charge and energy meter of the storage, "
"power of meters and PV inverters, the emergency reserve, the charge point "
"settings, grid-optimized charge, battery extension, § 14a and the release "
"for charging from the grid. Further components can be added in the options "
"of the integration, further entities activated in the entity list. The "
"instructions advise against activating several hundred channels at the same "
"time."
msgstr ""
"**Voreinstellung:** Nach dem Einrichten sind nur einige Komponenten und "
"darin nur wenige Kanäle aktiv, u. a. die Summenwerte (`+_sum+`: Verbrauch, "
"Erzeugung, Netz, Speicher), Ladezustand und Energiezähler des Speichers, "
"Leistung von Zählern und PV-Wechselrichtern, die Notstromreserve, die "
"Ladepunkt-Einstellungen, die netzdienliche Beladung, die Batterie-"
"Erweiterung, § 14a und die Freigabe zum Laden aus dem Netz. Weitere "
"Komponenten lassen sich in den Optionen der Integration zuschalten, weitere "
"Entitäten in der Entitätenliste aktivieren. Die Anleitung rät davon ab, "
"mehrere hundert Kanäle gleichzeitig zu aktivieren."

#. type: Plain text
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/third-party/home-assistant.adoc
msgid ""
"The energy meters from `+_sum+` (grid purchase, feed-in, production, storage "
"charge and discharge, see xref:user/basics/energy-flows.adoc[Energy flows]) "
"are suitable for the Home Assistant **energy dashboard**."
msgstr ""
"Für das **Energie-Dashboard** von Home Assistant eignen sich die "
"Energiezähler aus `+_sum+` (Netzbezug, Einspeisung, Erzeugung, Speicher-"
"Ladung und -Entladung, siehe xref:user/basics/energy-"
"flows.adoc[Energieflüsse])."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/third-party/home-assistant.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additional calculated values"
msgstr "Zusätzliche, berechnete Werte"

#. type: #sec-additional-calculated-values
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/third-party/home-assistant.adoc
msgid ""
"For batteries, the integration itself calculates the **voltage difference** "
"between the highest and lowest cell, for the entire battery and per module. "
"OpenEMS does not supply these values directly; they are created from the "
"cell voltages (see xref:user/systems/fenecon-home-battery.adoc[FENECON Home "
"battery]). For this, the cell voltage channels must be activated."
msgstr ""
"Für Batterien berechnet die Integration selbst die **Spannungsdifferenz** "
"zwischen höchster und niedrigster Zelle, für die Gesamtbatterie und je "
"Modul. Diese Werte liefert OpenEMS nicht direkt; sie entstehen aus den "
"Zellspannungen (siehe xref:user/systems/fenecon-home-battery.adoc[FENECON-"
"Home-Batterie]). Dafür müssen die Zellspannungs-Kanäle aktiviert sein."

#. type: Title ===
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/third-party/home-assistant.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ready-made cards"
msgstr "Fertige Karten"

#. type: #sec-ready-made-cards
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/third-party/home-assistant.adoc
msgid ""
"The integration comes with templates for dashboard cards: charge point, grid-"
"optimized charge, emergency reserve, heating element and a battery "
"diagnostics dashboard. They need additional card extensions from HACS."
msgstr ""
"Die Integration bringt Vorlagen für Dashboard-Karten mit: Ladepunkt, "
"netzdienliche Beladung, Notstromreserve, Heizstab sowie ein Batterie-"
"Diagnose-Dashboard. Sie brauchen zusätzliche Karten-Erweiterungen aus HACS."

#. type: Title ==
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/third-party/home-assistant.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid "What can be controlled"
msgstr "Was gesteuert werden kann"

#. type: #sec-what-can-be-controlled
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/third-party/home-assistant.adoc
msgid "The integration has three write routes. They differ fundamentally:"
msgstr ""
"Die Integration hat drei Schreibwege. Sie unterscheiden sich grundlegend:"

#. type: Table
#: modules/ROOT/pages/user/third-party/home-assistant.adoc
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Route\n"
"| What\n"
"| How\n"
"| Duration\n"
"| Required role\n"
"\n"
"| Changing a setting\n"
"| Switch, select, number, time; action “Update component configuration”\n"
"| updateComponentConfig via the websocket\n"
"| **permanent**, is stored\n"
"| Owner\n"
"| Setting a control value\n"
"| Action “REST write sensor” on a sensor\n"
"| POST to the REST interface of the system\n"
"| temporary, only as long as repeated\n"
"| according to the REST page Owner; REST write app required\n"
"| System update\n"
"| Update entity “Install”\n"
"| Call to `+_host+` via the websocket\n"
"| –\n"
"| Owner\n"
msgstr ""
"| Weg\n"
"| Was\n"
"| Wie\n"
"| Dauer\n"
"| nötige Rolle\n"
"\n"
"| Einstellung ändern\n"
"| Schalter, Auswahl, Zahl, Uhrzeit; Aktion „Komponenten-Konfiguration ändern“\n"
"| updateComponentConfig über den Websocket\n"
"| **dauerhaft**, wird gespeichert\n"
"| Eigentümer\n"
